  "title": "Origin Bancorp, Inc. Reports Earnings for Second | Origin Bank",
  "summary": "Origin Bancorp, Inc. (NYSE: OBK) (“Origin,” “we,” “our” or the “Company”), the holding company for Origin Bank (the “Bank”), today announced net income of $33.8 million, or $1.09 diluted earnings per share (“EPS”) for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, compared to net income of $27.7 million, or $0.89 diluted EPS, for the quarter ended March 31, 2026. Pre-tax, pre-provision (“PTPP”)(1) earnings were $43.2 million for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, compared to $40.2 million for the linked quarter.",
